{
  "title": "Questo libro nuovo {ip:è} bello",
  "translation": "This new book is beautiful",
  "topics": "Agreement of adjectives, the demonstratives questo and quello",
  "grammar": {
    "explain": [
      "An adjective agrees with its noun in gender and number. It usually comes after the noun: *un libro nuovo*.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Type",
            "Masc. sing.",
            "Fem. sing.",
            "Masc. pl.",
            "Fem. pl."
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "-o / -a",
              "nuov**o**",
              "nuov**a**",
              "nuov**i**",
              "nuov**e**"
            ],
            [
              "-e",
              "grand**e**",
              "grand**e**",
              "grand**i**",
              "grand**i**"
            ]
          ]
        }
      },
      "Examples: *un libro nuovo, due case nuove, un ragazzo inglese, una ragazza inglese*.",
      "*Questo* (this) points to something near you and changes like an adjective in -o: *questo libro, questa casa, questi libri, queste case*. Before a vowel, the singular may become *quest'*.",
      "*Quello* (that) points to something far away. Before a noun it changes like the definite article.",
      {
        "table": {
          "head": [
            "Like the article",
            "Singular",
            "Plural"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "il / i",
              "**quel** libro",
              "**quei** libri"
            ],
            [
              "lo / gli",
              "**quello** zaino",
              "**quegli** zaini"
            ],
            [
              "l' (masc.) / gli",
              "**quell'**amico",
              "**quegli** amici"
            ],
            [
              "la / le",
              "**quella** casa",
              "**quelle** case"
            ],
            [
              "l' (fem.) / le",
              "**quell'**amica",
              "**quelle** amiche"
            ]
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
